# shubhxho.com

Personal site for **Shubh Gupta** (`shubhxho`). Next.js 16 App Router. Style: sparse kdrag0n-like, JetBrains Mono, white canvas, `site-shell` (~40rem).

## Architecture

```
content/pages/*.mdx     → pages.ts      → /about /contact /privacy
content/blog/*.mdx      → posts.ts      → blog.ts → /blog
content/people/*.mdx    → people.ts     → /people (gratitude)
content/**/*.md         → content.ts    → homepage, gallery, history
                          markdown.ts
```

| Task | Edit | Loader |
|------|------|--------|
| Homepage copy + labels | `content/home.md` | `getHomeContent()` |
| Projects | `content/projects/*.md` | `getProjects()` |
| Blog | `content/blog/*.mdx` | `getAllPosts()` / `getPost()` |
| Gallery mosaic | `content/gallery.md` | `getGalleryContent()` |
| History / timeline | `content/timeline.md` | `getTimeline()` |
| Gratitude / people | `content/people/*.mdx` | `getAllPeople()` / `getPerson()` |
| About / contact / privacy | `content/pages/*.mdx` | `getPage()` in `pages.ts` |
| Indexable URLs | — | `src/app/sitemap.ts` |
| URL, email, socials only | `src/lib/site.ts` | — |

## Default workflow

1. **Copy or new posts** → markdown in `content/` only
2. **Layout / behavior** → `src/components/` + `src/app/`
3. **Never** import `@/lib/content`, `@/lib/people`, `@/lib/posts`, or `@/lib/pages` in `"use client"` files — types from `@/lib/content-types` only
4. **Verify** → `npm test` (build + agentic smoke tests)
5. **Commit** only when the user asks

## Routes

`/`, `/blog`, `/blog/[slug]`, `/gallery`, `/history`, `/people`, `/people/[slug]`, `/about`, `/contact`, `/privacy`

Gratitude is the public name; URLs are `/people`. Old `/gratitude` paths redirect.

Agent endpoints (do not break): `/llms.txt`, `/llms-full.txt`, `/profile.md`, `/feed.xml`, `/sitemap.xml`, `/people.md`, markdown negotiation via `src/proxy.ts`

## Commands

```bash
npm run dev    # http://localhost:3000
npm run build
npm test
```
